  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP: National Demobilization and Reintegration Programme (NDRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aims is to support the GoE&#x2019;s National Demobilization and Reintegration Programme with regards to: demobilization; reinsertion benefits; MHPSS; addressing SGBV; rehabilitation support for people with disabilities; capacity building of NRC and implementing partners; communication and outreach; monitoring and evaluation; and provision of DDR advisors and consultants. As a result, this will contribute to the implementation of the CoHA agreement (particularly Article 6 &#x2013; on DDR) and ensure in the short term that XCs receive peace dividends.</narrative>
  </description>
